        "jsCode": "return [{\n  json: {\n    post_id: \"reddit_1xia00g\",\n    platform: \"Reddit\",\n    author: \"Objective-Daikon3383\",\n    text: `Hi everyone,\n\nI’m looking for a skilled web developer to help me with a website project. If you have experience in web development and are interested in working together, please DM me.\n\nWhen messaging me, please share your skills, relevant portfolio or previous work, and your rates.\n\nBudget: Open to discussion\nProject details: Will be shared via DM\nContact: DM me if you're interested.`,\n    post_url: \"https://www.reddit.com/r/freelancer_hire/comments/1xia00g/hiring_web_developer_needed_for_a_website_project/\",\n    published_at: null,\n    discovered_at: new Date().toISOString(),\n    ingestion_method: \"manual_public_post\"\n  }\n}];"
